10
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.500
Julia,

11
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.300
Te envié la dirección.

12
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.780
Recuerda ir hoy.

13
00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:45.560
Tu prima,

14
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.780
