15
00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.400
una gran cita a ciegas para ti.

16
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.100
Sé una buena chica.

17
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.460
Si vas,

18
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.300
tu prima me prestara

19
00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.260
